# "At the beginning of each end step": the opponent's end step counts too. Bot1 cast Vren on turn 1 and keeps a Mox Ruby untapped. On
# Bot2's turn 2, once Bot2's Llanowar Elves is on the battlefield, Bot1 bolts it: Vren exiles it instead of letting it die. At the beginning of Bot2's end
# step Bot1's Vren makes a Rat (X = 1, a creature exiled under an opponent's control that turn), 2/2 beside Vren.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Vren, the Relentless
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Vren, the Relentless.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile = Llanowar Elves
? Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 4
[T2 Bot2.End]
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Exile = Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Turn = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Rat Token.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Rat Token.Toughness = 2
